  "id": "copd",
  "term": "COPD",
  "definition": "COPD is a chronic lung disease in which airflow becomes persistently and progressively limited, but it is considered preventable and treatable. In cognition-related contexts, it is also recognized as a broader systemic condition because it can occur alongside other health problems, including cognitive impairment.",
